aracter that just works harder than  his more talented  peers but we haven't really seen that in  the anime or the manga  even in a world where anyone can be a  hero it seems like some people are still  just average check out one of our newest  videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

